    "body": "## Scope\n\nAdds a loopback-only browser interface for two synthetic Chat03 participants and a separate Node bootstrap that creates a local test battle through the existing private API.\n\n- Browser API client is fixed to `http://127.0.0.1:8787` and rejects non-loopback endpoints.\n- Admin capability is read only by the local Node bootstrap from ignored `gameplay-server/.dev.vars`; it never enters browser code or browser requests.\n- Player tokens remain in page memory only. No browser storage, cookies, telemetry, or Stage 7.15 wiring.\n- Adds local run instructions, focused Node safety tests, and includes them in Chat03B2 CI.\n\n## Explicitly out of scope\n\nNo Cloudflare API, hosted gameplay Worker/D1, public deployment, production or main writes, telemetry changes, and no Stage 7.15 onboarding changes. This is a local interface for the source-integrated API, not online gameplay or production acceptance.\n\n## Validation\n\nExact-head GitHub Actions will run the new focused safety tests and the existing local Worker/D1 suite. Browser/Safari acceptance remains user-owned.",
